Hi,
Version 0.30 is finally out. Changes include:
- support for M6R, A3G, W3N, A4G, W5A
- Bluetooth and LED display support
- rework model detection to fix problems on Samsung P30/35 and similar

Grab the tarball from the usual places:
http://sourceforge.net/projects/acpi4asus/
http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=81433

